Quelle est la différence entre `while` et `do...while` ?

```javascript
// Cas 1: while
let i = 5;
while (i < 3) {
  console.log('while:', i);
  i++;
}

// Cas 2: do...while
let j = 5;
do {
  console.log('do-while:', j);
  j++;
} while (j < 3);
```

